{"scenario": {"window_size": "1440x900", "description": "PLAN §3 workflow A end to end, the agent played by the real dv CLI (this dv.exe as a child process: cli, cli_spawn, cli_join) and the reviewer by keyboard alone. The agent's `dv review wait` blocks while the reviewer comments and requests changes, then wakes with changes_requested; the agent lists the open thread, fixes the code (lines inserted above the thread), replies over stdin, addresses and says done with a note; dv shows round 2 as the interdiff since round 1 with the ready banner and the thread moved to its new lines; the reviewer resolves it and approves; the agent's second wait wakes with approved. Screenshots in dark Mica and one light."}}
